<title>UK: Rheinboden Hypo sets 200 mln mark step-up bond.</title>
<headline>Rheinboden Hypo sets 200 mln mark step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Sal Oppenheim.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RHEINBODEN HYPOTHEKENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN DEM   COUPON   **4.0	 MATURITY  **14.NOV.01</p>
<p> TYPE   STEP-UP	 ISS PRICE  101.90    PAY DATE   S14.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 LISTING    DUES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> NOTES	**CALLABLE ON 14.NOV.97 WHEN COUPON THEN STEPS UP TO</p>
<p>		5.20 PCT</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.75	DENOMS (K)  1</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
